   <string>Specifying different values in imm8 will allow any arbitrary three-input Boolean functions to be implemented in software using VPTERNLOGD/Q. </string><link linkend="10518: 06_Table: Table 5-1. Left-Half Map of VTERNLOG Boolean Logic Operations"><string>Table 5&#8209;1</string></link><string> and </string><link linkend="43099: 06_Table: Table 5-2. Right-Half Map of VTERNLOG Boolean Logic Operation"><string>Table 5&#8209;2</string></link><string> provide a mapping of all 256 possible imm8 values to various Boolean expressions.</string></para>
